extra.translation:
A place needs people. people from everywhere
Alongside the *mandingueiros*,
From *Angola* and *Regional* styles.

The *berimbau* plays softly, signaling the moment;
If the game holds a secret, it reveals itself now.

The time has come, and everyone is waiting;
The *gunga* speaks out, starting the *roda*.

We are searching, looking to find it;
Once found, there’s no turning back—lower your body and play.

It’s a new day for the *mandingueiro* and his style of play;
It doesn't matter, *camarada*—the call has come to play the game.
